  "__node_policy_note": "package.json engines requires node >=24.11.1 <24.16.0 and .npmrc sets engine-strict=true. v24.11.1 is installed under nvm and verified (pnpm install, docs:check, typecheck all pass). Every pnpm command keeps the explicit nvm prefix because the shell does not auto-select it: nvm is sourced only in ~/.bashrc and the repo-local .envrc needs a direnv hook that is not active. Do not weaken this prefix to whatever version happens to be on PATH.",
